            <ArticleTitle>Retraction Note: Effects of Bariatric Surgery on Incidence of Obesity-Related Cancers: A Meta-Analysis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1751</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the article entitled, &quot;Effects of Bariatric Surgery on Incidence of Obesity-Related Cancers: A Meta-Analysis&quot; which was published in Medical Science Monitor 2015;21: 1350-1357, sections in the text have been directly copied from a previously published article, entitled, &quot;The Effects of Bariatric Surgery on Colorectal Cancer Risk: Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis&quot;, Sorena Afshar, Seamus B. Kelly, Keith Seymour, Jose Lara, Sean Woodcock, John C. Mathers  in Obesity Surgery 2014; 24(10):1793-1799. Thus owing to duplicity of text, the article is being retracted. Reference: 1. Xiang-wu Yang, Peng-zhou Li, Li-yong Zhu, Shaihong Zhu Effects of Bariatric Surgery on Incidence of Obesity-Related Cancers: A Meta-Analysis Medical Science Monitor 2015;21: 1350-1357 DOI: 10.12659/MSM.893553.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
